{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105694","id":2477154030,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Tpl7u","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105694","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105694.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105694.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105694","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105694/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105694/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105694/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8d67de9559a9f17f351cdba124d3fe186a608e2d","number":105694,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add missing `backward` flag to TRS3D & BlendShape Track's interpolation in the `AnimationMixer` for Nearest interpolation","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Context: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105385\r\n\r\nThe `backward` flag was added by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92861 to handle backward nearest interpolation. It was applied to ValueTrack, but not applied TRS3D & BlendShape Tracks so now apply it to them.\r\n\r\nThis changes the behavior of the reverse playback when Nearest mode is used in TRS3D & Blend Track, so the break compat label is added (but that means it has been fixed to a more correct and expected result).\r\n\r\nIn the case:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95cd478f-3f99-4e43-92ba-10b413b1ba64)\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/357c7790-fe10-447c-a62d-2e2845b645f9\r\n\r\nAfter fix:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ee7c73b-e962-4e55-86a8-175422d7eb53\r\n\r\nNote that scrubbing in the editor does not affect it, as it cannot determine if it is playing backwards or not (to see the effect as debugging/testing, you must play it back with play()). This would be consistent behavior with ValueTrack.\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-23T19:17:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T16:51:52Z","closed_at":"2026-06-26T16:19:53Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"834f9df42115d936abe422e9087c0137c5ff2ab0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TokageItLab:nearest-back-trs","ref":"nearest-back-trs","repo":{"id":289170836,"node_id":